        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8423, Single Cylinder Disc Modern Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Disc Deadbolt is a stylish, round single cylinder lock suitable for most house facelifts. This high-quality deadbolt is available in many contemporary finish color options. It will fit most pre-drilled doors, so changing your old front door lock will be super easy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8423-specifications.gif?v=1704354769\" width=\"600\" height=\"228\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 8423 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Disc Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8423-specifications.pdf?v=1704262421\"><b>Emtek 8423 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
